and GLSL ES 300, which do not allow implicit int-to-uint conversions.

shaders/fsr_compat.glsl supplies only the FP32 portability helpers needed
by this header, adapted from the same revision of ffx-fsr/ffx_a.h.
The portable half packer avoids requiring newer desktop GL extensions;
EASU and RCAS themselves run in FP32.
